  "details": "(Quest 2) \n\nWhen I join a world with background music enabled on join (Play On Awake) it will not play if you preload the world. (or if you rejoin)\n\n-Basically if you dont see the VRchat \"go\" or \"downloading\" screen when you enter a world, Play On Awake sounds will not play.\n\nEnabling the \"go button on load\" option on settings makes the sound work normally on rejoin as I demonstrate in my video. \n\nhttps://streamable.com/n4y9az\n\nWorld downloading screen = Audio works.\n\n\"go\" button enabled on load = Audio works\n\nLoading a preloaded world (no vrchat load music played) = Audio does not work.\n\nOn My video, the beach sound will only play when I see the \"downloading\" message, or when i manually press the \"go\" button. \n\nWhen Rejoining (preloading) it will not play the beach sound (it is on PlayOnAwake)",
